  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-03",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اُدْرُسْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:1",
    "cell:1:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-04",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اُخْرُجْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:2",
    "cell:2:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-05",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اُدْخُلْ",
   "pause": 0.45,
   "cues": [
    "row:3",
    "cell:3:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-06",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So they start with alif and damma.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-07",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In the next four, the middle letter has fatha or kasra. No damma.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-08",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِذْهَبْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:4",
    "cell:4:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-09",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِجْلِسْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:5",
    "cell:5:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-10",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِفْتَحْ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "row:6",
    "cell:6:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-11",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِشْرَبْ",
   "pause": 0.45,
   "cues": [
    "row:7",
    "cell:7:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-table-12",
   "scene": "c07-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So they start with alif and kasra.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "unhl"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-tip-01",
   "scene": "c07-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The past verb does not tell you the middle vowel of the order verb.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c07-tip-02",
   "scene": "c07-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So learn each order verb as a word.",
   "pause": 0.7,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-title-01",
   "scene": "c08-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Chapter eight. The helping kasra, from Stage 2.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-title-02",
   "scene": "c08-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A word cannot end in sukūn right before al.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-title-03",
   "scene": "c08-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "So the sukūn becomes a small kasra. The verb is still fixed.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-01",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Open the door.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-02",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "اِفْتَحِ البَابَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "read:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-03",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The order verb ends in sukūn. Before al, it takes a small kasra.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "note:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-04",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is still built on sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-05",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The girl did not write the lesson.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "ex:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-06",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَا كَتَبَتِ البِنْتُ الدَّرْسَ",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "read:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-07",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Here the kasra sits on the ḥarf at the end of the verb.",
   "pause": 0.25,
   "cues": [
    "note:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-examples-08",
   "scene": "c08-examples",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "And the word for not changes nothing.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c08-tip-01",
   "scene": "c08-tip",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "This kasra is only a bridge for speaking. It is not jarr, and not iʿrāb.",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-01",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "In short.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-02",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Past and order verbs are fixed. The present verb is mostly flexible. It comes in Stage 8.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "item:0"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-03",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The past verb has fourteen persons.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "item:1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-04",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Endings like these are doer pronouns, in the place of rafʿ. But the ending of she wrote is a ḥarf.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "item:2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-05",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The past verb is built on fatha, on damma, or on sukūn.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "item:3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-06",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "To say did not, put this word before a past verb.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "item:4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-07",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَا كَتَبَ",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-08",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "It is a ḥarf with no place.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-09",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "The order verb is built on sukūn, or on dropping the noon.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "item:5"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "sum-10",
   "scene": "sum",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "A middle damma gives alif with damma. Otherwise, alif with kasra.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": [
    "item:6"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "outro-yourturn-01",
   "scene": "outro-yourturn",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Now it is your turn. Open the Practice tab.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": [
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "outro-yourturn-02",
   "scene": "outro-yourturn",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Choose the past form, say what it is built on, and give the order.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "outro-yourturn-03",
   "scene": "outro-yourturn",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Good luck.",
